How was the donation of the PPE reflected in the Company’s 2019, 2020 and 2021 Annual Surveillance Report (ASRs)? Which line items in Section 2 Rate Base and Section 2 Income were impacted by donations? Quantify the impact of the donations on Section 2 Rate Base and Section 2 Income line items.

